   "text": "The University of Newcastle College of International Education (CIE) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nThe University of Newcastle College of International Education (CIE)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Newcastle College of International Education is the official on-campus pathway college to the University of Newcastle, providing entry to over 130 undergraduate and postgraduate degrees at a world-class university. The University of Newcastle is ranked in the top 200 universities in the world (QS World University Rankings 2021) and is distinguished by its world-leading research and degree programs. The university has more than 37,000 students from 114 countries, providing a vibrant and diverse experience that combines a high-quality academic environment with opportunities to engage in cultural, social and sporting activities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n04/05/2026 06:13\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:34\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$39,450.00\nMin: A$16,740.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n1,240 of 12,400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1951\nCampus(es)\nNewcastle\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n15/04/2026\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=frA-_XFDzdU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
